    /// <summary>
    /// Enable or disable the block storage capability of EKS Auto Mode when creating your EKS Auto Mode cluster. If the block storage capability is enabled, EKS Auto Mode will create and delete EBS volumes in your Amazon Web Services account. blockStorage -&gt; (structure) Request to configure EBS Block Storage settings for your EKS Auto Mode cluster. enabled -&gt; (boolean) Indicates if the block storage capability is enabled on your EKS Auto Mode cluster. If the block storage capability is en- abled, EKS Auto Mode will create and delete EBS volumes in your Amazon Web Services account. Shorthand Syntax: blockStorage={enabled=boolean} JSON Syntax: { "blockStorage": { "enabled": true|false } }
