    /// <summary>
    /// The Kubernetes scheduler configuration for the new cluster. nodeResourcesFit -&gt; (structure) The node resource fit scoring configuration for the scheduler. scoringStrategy -&gt; (structure) The scoring strategy used to rank nodes during scheduling. type -&gt; (string) The scoring strategy type. Valid values are LeastAllo- cated or MostAllocated . Possible values: o LeastAllocated o MostAllocated resources -&gt; (list) The resource weights used for scoring nodes. Constraints: o max: 100 (structure) A resource weight entry for the scheduler scoring strategy. name -&gt; (string) The name of the resource (for example, cpu or mem- ory ). Constraints: o min: 1 o max: 253 weight -&gt; (integer) The weight assigned to the resource for scoring. Must be between 1 and 100. Constraints: o min: 1 o max: 100 JSON Syntax: { "nodeResourcesFit": { "scoringStrategy": { "type": "LeastAllocated"|"MostAllocated", "resources": [ { "name": "string", "weight": integer } ... ] } } }
